                                                  'assessment.</p>\n'
                                                  '<h3>Unreliable connectivity</h3>\n'
                                                  '<p>Conference rooms in basements, meetings during travel, offsite retreats with spotty WiFi. Offline transcription just works regardless of your '
                                                  'connection.</p>\n'
                                                  '<h2>What you get</h2>\n'
                                                  '<ul>\n'
                                                  '    <li><strong>Full transcript</strong> with timestamps</li>\n'
